<br/>
With shipping times now into 2027, the iPhone Duo is no longer available in time for delivery before Christmas through Apple's online store.<br/>
<br/>
It may still be possible to secure an iPhone Duo far earlier than January by visiting an Apple Store on October 23 launch day. However, based on how quickly shipping times slipped, it seems likely that most locations will have extremely tight inventory for walk-in customers. iPhone Duo is also available at resellers like Best Buy.<br/>
